Title: Parse and Extract Data from FlowJo v11 Workspace Files
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: person("Bernd", "Jagla", email = "bernd.jagla@pasteur.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to parse FlowJo v11 workspace files (.flowjo) and extract gating information, populations, and associated FCS files. Includes utilities for exporting data to FlowJo v10 workspace format.
